know what to do. There'll be war. I can't <b>allow</b> either of them to be king. <b>Therefore</b>, I'm making you king. Your kindness has always made you special. It's the <b>difference</b> between you and your brothers. You can bring <b>peace</b>. They can't.\"</p>    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Then the king died. Theseus and Pelias heard that their youngest brother was king. They were surprised.</p>    <p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem;\">They realized that their fighting was wrong. It had kept them from saying goodbye to their father. They agreed to have Jason as their king. He was the best choice.</p></div>",
